@host = https://localhost:7097

### Products are imported while the next supplier page is loading (12 successful results).
POST {{host}}/catalog-imports
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pages": 3, "pageSize": 4, "pageDelayMs": 750 }

### A fast source: the request still waits for all 100 handlers to finish.
POST {{host}}/catalog-imports
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pages": 4, "pageSize": 25, "pageDelayMs": 0 }

### Invalid input returns 400 before creating a queue.
